              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2 style=\"font-family:'IvyOra Banner', 'Project Chinese Light', serif;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:6.410256vw;line-height:8.333333vw;letter-spacing:normal\">Murad |<br/>\n<span style=\"font-family:'Project Chinese Bold', sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:6.410256vw;line-height:8.333333vw;letter-spacing:normal\">海 港 城</span></h2>",
